SUMMARY:✈️ 到Pearson 3号航站楼
DESCRIPTION:国际航班提前3小时到。女朋友带中国护照、美
 签（确认是多次入境M）和PR卡。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T233451Z
DTSTART:20270106T154000Z
DTEND:20270106T212400Z
SUMMARY:✈️ Porter PD 783 多伦多 → 利比里亚
DESCRIPTION:直飞约5小时44分。起飞是多伦多时间，落地是当
 地时间（比多伦多晚1小时）。落地后入境盖章（确认护
 照上有章），拿行李后到Dollar接驳点。\n\n📍 Daniel Oduber 
 Quirós International Airport\, Corredor Chorotega\, Llano Grande\, Liberi
 a\, Guanacaste\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Da
 niel%20Oduber%20Quir%C3%B3s%20International%20Airport
LOCATION:Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airport\, Corredor Chorotega\,
  Llano Grande\, Liberia\, Guanacaste
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Daniel%20Oduber%20Qu
 ir%C3%B3s%20International%20Airport
GEO:10.5917;-85.5411
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Corredor Chorotega, Llano 
 Grande, Liberia, Guanacaste";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Daniel Oduber Qui
 rós International Airport":geo:10.5917,-85.5411
END:VEVENT
