SUMMARY:🚗 取车
DESCRIPTION:带实体驾照、护照和本人信用卡（押金约USD1\,000
 ）。检查车况拍照；手动确认车门锁好，这里租车被撬
 很常见。\n\n🚗 路程：从 Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airp
 ort 开车约 4 分钟（3.4 公里）\n\n📍 Dollar Rent a Car Liberia\,
  Corredor Chorotega\, Llano Grande\, Liberia\, Guanacaste\n🧭 https://ww
 w.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Dollar%20Rent%20a%20Car%20Liberia
